cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EWALD in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "EWALD: Extensible Workbench for Atomic Lattices & Dynamics"
abstract: >-
  A notebook for atomistic structures and trajectories (VASP, LAMMPS and other formats) with
  a Python pipeline API, OVITO-compatible analysis modifiers, CPU/GPU compute, a ray tracer and
  vector output for publication figures, an AI assistant and plugins.
type: software
